        "final_answer": "（1）证明：由 a_{n+1}/n = a_n/(n+1) + 1/[n(n+1)]，两边同乘 n(n+1) 得 (n+1)a_{n+1} = n a_n + 1，即 (n+1)a_{n+1} − n a_n = 1（常数），故 {n a_n} 是首项为 3、公差为 1 的等差数列。\n（2）由（1）得 n a_n = 3 + (n−1)·1 = n+2，故 a_n = (n+2)/n = 1 + 2/n。\nf′(x) = Σ_{k=1}^{m} k a_k x^{k−1} = Σ_{k=1}^{m} (k+2) x^{k−1}，\nf′(−2) = Σ_{k=1}^{m} (k+2)(−2)^{k−1} = [7 − (3m+7)(−2)^m] / 9。",
